OL,3,GNEWSASeveral roads closed after serious
OL,4,Acollision in Aberdeen
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral roads in Aberdeen have been
OL,7,Fclosed after a serious collision.
OL,9,FThe incident happened in the city's
OL,10,FVictoria Road shortly after 10:00.
OL,12,FThe Scottish Ambulance Service said a
OL,13,Fspecial operations response team, a
OL,14,Fparamedic response unit and an
OL,15,Fambulance were sent to the scene.
OL,17,FPolice Scotland said several roads in
OL,18,Fthe area were closed as a result,
OL,19,Fincluding at the Wellington Road
OL,20,Froundabout, Victoria Bridge, and South
OL,21,FEsplanade East.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
